#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:1
msgid "Data and binding"
msgstr "Data e binding"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:5
msgid ""
"Every page has one Data tree. Elements point at its values with short "
"strings called **pointers**. This page covers what you need in every page; "
"every option is in the [Data and logic reference](515-data-and-logic-"
"reference.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ogni pagina ha un solo albero Data. Gli elementi puntano ai suoi valori con "
"brevi stringhe chiamate **puntatori**. Qui trovi ciò che serve in ogni "
"pagina; tutte le opzioni sono nella [reference di Data e logica](515-data-"
"and-logic-reference.md) (in inglese)."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:9
msgid "<a id=\"gc-510-005\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:11
msgid "005 · Paths and `datapath`"
msgstr "005 · Percorsi e `datapath`"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:15
msgid ""
"A Data path is a dotted name: `customer.name`. A path that starts with a dot"
" is **relative** to the nearest `datapath` above it."
msgstr ""
"Un percorso Data è un nome puntato: `customer.name`. Un percorso che inizia "
"con un punto è **relativo** al `datapath` più vicino sopra di lui."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:24
msgid ""
"Give two panels different `datapath` values and they keep separate values."
msgstr "Due pannelli con `datapath` diversi tengono valori separati."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:26
msgid "<a id=\"gc-510-010\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:28
msgid "010 · Three kinds of pointer"
msgstr "010 · Tre tipi di puntatore"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "You write"
msgstr "Scrivi"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "It means"
msgstr "Significa"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "`'^.name'`"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "Read `name` and **follow** it: update when it changes."
msgstr "Legge `name` e lo **segue**: si aggiorna quando cambia."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "`'=.name'`"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "Read `name` once, when needed, without following it."
msgstr "Legge `name` una volta, quando serve, senza seguirlo."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "`'==a + b'`"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "Compute a JavaScript expression in the browser."
msgstr "Calcola un'espressione JavaScript nel browser."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:38
msgid ""
"Use `^` almost everywhere. Use `=` to pass a value to code without "
"triggering it."
msgstr ""
"Usa `^` quasi ovunque. Usa `=` per passare un valore al codice senza farlo "
"scattare."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:40
msgid "<a id=\"gc-510-015\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:42
msgid "015 · Fields write back"
msgstr "015 · I campi riscrivono i valori"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:46
msgid ""
"A field bound with `value='^.name'` shows the value **and** writes the "
"user's edit into the Data."
msgstr ""
"Un campo legato con `value='^.name'` mostra il valore **e** scrive nei Data "
"la modifica dell'utente."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:49
msgid "By default it writes when the field loses focus or the user confirms."
msgstr "Di default scrive quando il campo perde il focus o l'utente conferma."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:50
msgid "`live=True` writes at every keystroke."
msgstr "`live=True` scrive a ogni tasto."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:51
msgid ""
"A checkbox writes `true` or `false`; a number field writes a number or null."
msgstr ""
"Una checkbox scrive `true` o `false`; un campo numerico scrive un numero o "
"null."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:53
msgid "<a id=\"gc-510-020\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:55
msgid "020 · Initial values"
msgstr "020 · Valori iniziali"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:59
msgid "Most values arrive from the server. For the rest:"
msgstr "La maggior parte dei valori arriva dal server. Per il resto:"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:66
msgid ""
"A `default` never overwrites an existing value, not even `0`, `False` or "
"`\"\"`."
msgstr ""
"Un `default` non sovrascrive mai un valore esistente, nemmeno `0`, `False` o"
" `\"\"`."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:68
msgid "<a id=\"gc-510-025\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:70
msgid "025 · Computing and reacting"
msgstr "025 · Calcolare e reagire"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "Need"
msgstr "Ti serve"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "Declaration"
msgstr "Dichiarazione"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "A value computed from others"
msgstr "Un valore calcolato da altri"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "`dataFormula`"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "Run code when a value changes"
msgstr "Eseguire codice quando un valore cambia"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "`dataController`"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "Run code on a click"
msgstr "Eseguire codice a un clic"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md
msgid "a `dataController` inside a `button`"
msgstr "un `dataController` dentro un `button`"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:85
msgid ""
"Arguments with `^` trigger the declaration; arguments with `=` are only "
"read."
msgstr ""
"Gli argomenti con `^` fanno scattare la dichiarazione; quelli con `=` "
"vengono solo letti."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:87
msgid "<a id=\"gc-510-030\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:89
msgid "030 · Where the code goes: `Logic`"
msgstr "030 · Dove va il codice: `Logic`"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:93
msgid ""
"`func=\"add\"` names a method of the `Logic` class in the JavaScript file "
"with the page's name: `orders.js` beside `orders.py`."
msgstr ""
"`func=\"add\"` indica un metodo della classe `Logic` nel file JavaScript con"
" il nome della pagina: `orders.js` accanto a `orders.py`."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:104
msgid ""
"Inside a controller, `node.SET(path, value)` writes Data and "
"`node.GET(path)` reads it. Inline code such as `formula=\"a + b\"` also "
"works, but is discouraged: it needs a Content Security Policy that allows "
"`'unsafe-eval'`."
msgstr ""
"In un controller, `node.SET(path, value)` scrive nei Data e `node.GET(path)`"
" legge. Funziona anche il codice inline come `formula=\"a + b\"`, ma è "
"sconsigliato: richiede una Content Security Policy che consenta `'unsafe-"
"eval'`."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:108
msgid "<a id=\"gc-510-035\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:110
msgid "035 · Formatting text"
msgstr "035 · Formattare il testo"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/510-data-and-binding.md:119
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`mask` and `:` templates put the value where `{}` is. They never change the "
"Data."
msgstr ""
"`mask` e i template con `:` mettono il valore al posto di `{}`. Non "
"modificano mai i Data."

